只输出严格JSON，恰好包含id（metadata.id原样）、summary_zh（15到140个Unicode字符，通常40到100字）、category（枚举）、tags（2到5个不重复关键词，每个最多30字符）、confidence（0到1，仅自评）、insufficient_evidence（布尔）、evidence（1到3个对象，每个恰好包含paragraph_id、fact）、limitations（0到5个字符串）。只选择输入中长度20至120字符的完整片段编号；fact是该片段支持的中文事实转述。不要输出quote，不要自行抄写、拼接、删改或补造引用。程序会按编号附上原文。一个编号只用一次；最多3条证据。不得增加字段。
摘要和limitations保留会改变功能意义的前提、平台例外和限制：设密码后才认证、页面保持打开才提醒、依赖外部组件、估算不等于保证。只写已实现功能，不将规划当完成。证据不足就标记，不编造。
图像识别/分类不是媒体创作，没有贴切类别归other；量化、计算与领域研究归search-research，不因多智能体实现归agents-automation；模型/CLI适配与插件开发工具归coding-development；市场/精选目录按搜索发现归search-research。不要按附属同步、备份或评论功能分类。不要推断本机客户端等于本地模型。
摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"Research plugins for DeepSeek Harness — a pnpm monorepo adding web search and MCP (Model Context Protocol) bridges for AI research, web scraping, and live documentation to your DSH agent.","id":"gh:1338913551","install_available":false,"language":"JavaScript","name":"dsh-research-plugins","slug":"PyModel/dsh-research-plugins","topics":["dsh-plugin"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"Research plugins for DeepSeek Harness — a pnpm monorepo adding web search and MCP (Model Context Pro"},{"id":"p1s2","text":"tocol) bridges for AI research, web scraping, and live documentation to your DSH agent."},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# dsh-research-plugins"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"Research plugins for DeepSeek Harness — a pnpm monorepo adding web search and MCP (Model Context Pro"},{"id":"p3s2","text":"tocol) bridges for AI research, web scraping, and live documentation to your DSH agent."},{"id":"p4s1","text":"What this is ·\nInstall ·\nAPI keys ·\nRepo layout ·\nLicense"},{"id":"p5s1","text":"## What this is"},{"id":"p6s1","text":"**dsh-research-plugins** gives your DeepSeek Harness (DSH) agent three research superpowers it does "},{"id":"p6s2","text":"not have out of the box:"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"- **Web search** via the Tavily Search API — a settings toggle that swaps the built-in DeepSeek sear"},{"id":"p7s2","text":"ch for Tavily, with keyless search support.\n- **Web scraping & crawling** via the Firecrawl MCP serv"},{"id":"p7s3","text":"er — scrape, crawl, map, and search the open web inside tool calls.\n- **Up-to-date library docs** vi"},{"id":"p7s4","text":"a the Context7 MCP server — on-demand documentation and code examples for any library or framework."},{"id":"p8s1","text":"Everything is delivered as drop-in **DSH plugins** — no vendor lock-in, no forks, just a `dsh plugin"},{"id":"p8s2","text":"is delivered as drop-in **DSH plugins** — no vendor lock-in, no forks, just a `dsh plugin add` away."},{"id":"p9s1","text":"| Package | What it adds |"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"| `@pymodel/dsh-tavily` | Tavily Search API as a web search provider (settings toggle, keyless searc"},{"id":"p10s2","text":"h) + a Tavily MCP bridge (`tavily_search` / `tavily_extract` keyless; `tavily_crawl` / `tavily_map` "},{"id":"p10s3","text":"/ `tavily_research` with a key) |\n| `dsh-mcp-firecrawl` | Firecrawl MCP: keyless `search` / `scrape`"},{"id":"p10s4","text":" / `parse`; full tool surface with an API key |\n| `dsh-mcp-context7` | Context7 MCP: `mcp__context7_"},{"id":"p10s5","text":"_*` up-to-date library docs and code examples |"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"## Install"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"Each package installs independently into a DSH profile:"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"Or follow GitHub (this repo, latest commits):"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"## API keys"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"The MCP bridges use the harness's shipped `@deepseek-ai/dsh-mcp-client`. They read keys from the **l"},{"id":"p17s2","text":"aunch environment** (a real env var, the project `.env`, or `$DSH_HOME/.env`) — not from `$DSH_HOME/"},{"id":"p17s3","text":" (a real env var, the project `.env`, or `$DSH_HOME/.env`) — not from `$DSH_HOME/.credentials.yaml`:"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"| Plugin | Env var | Required | Endpoint |"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"| `dsh-tavily` (MCP part) | `TAVILY_API_KEY` | no (keyless MCP: search + extract; crawl / map / rese"},{"id":"p19s2","text":"arch need a key) | `https://mcp.tavily.com/mcp/` |\n| `dsh-mcp-firecrawl` | `FIRECRAWL_API_KEY` | no "},{"id":"p19s3","text":"(keyless: search/scrape/parse; full surface with a key) | `https://mcp.firecrawl.dev/v2/mcp` |\n| `ds"},{"id":"p19s4","text":"h-mcp-context7` | `CONTEXT7_API_KEY` | no (keyless works) | `https://mcp.context7.com/mcp` |"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"Keys are sent as an `Authorization: Bearer` header at load time — never in the URL and never in plai"},{"id":"p20s2","text":"n YAML. Without a key the bridges run in each vendor's documented keyless mode (`X-Tavily-Access-Mod"},{"id":"p20s3","text":"e: keyless` for Tavily), so every row works out of the box. A key added to `.env` needs a `dsh web` "},{"id":"p20s4","text":"ss` for Tavily), so every row works out of the box. A key added to `.env` needs a `dsh web` restart."},{"id":"p21s1","text":"### Already have your own MCP row?"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"The bundles insert loader entries `mcp-tavily`, `mcp-firecrawl` and `mcp-context7`. If your profile'"},{"id":"p22s2","text":"s `cordis.patch.yml` also inserts one of those ids, DSH refuses to boot (`duplicate loader entry id:"},{"id":"p22s3","text":" mcp-tavily`) and DSH Desktop opens Safe Mode. A second row under another id with the same `serverNa"},{"id":"p22s4","text":"me` fails too (`serverName \"tavily\" is already in use`)."},{"id":"p23s1","text":"Delete your own row, or keep your settings (a proxy or gateway URL, say) by turning it into an overr"},{"id":"p23s2","text":"ide of the plugin's row. An override replaces the whole `config`, so restate every key:"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"## Repo layout"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p27s1","text":"The Firecrawl and Context7 packages are pure-config bundles (`package.json` + `cordis.patch.yml` + i"},{"id":"p27s2","text":"con and `locale/` titles) with no build step. The Tavily package keeps its hand-written `lib/` and b"},{"id":"p27s3","text":"rowser client; there is no build."},{"id":"p28s1","text":"All three declare `engines.dsh: \">=0.1.5-rc.2 <0.3.0-0\"`: DSH 0.1.5 (DSH Desktop) through 0.2.x."},{"id":"p29s1","text":"## Development"},{"id":"p30s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p31s1","text":"CI runs the suite against the locked DSH 0.2 packages and against 0.1.5-rc.2 (DSH Desktop). Releases"},{"id":"p31s2","text":" publish from the `Publish to npm` workflow when a GitHub release is published, with npm provenance."},{"id":"p32s1","text":"## Contributing"},{"id":"p33s1","text":"Issues and pull requests are welcome. Please open a discussion on GitHub before starting large chang"},{"id":"p33s2","text":"ues and pull requests are welcome. Please open a discussion on GitHub before starting large changes."},{"id":"p34s1","text":"## Author"},{"id":"p35s1","text":"**elkaix** · pymodel"},{"id":"p36s1","text":"## License"},{"id":"p37s1","text":"MIT © 2026 PyModel LLC"}],"truncated":false}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
